    ]
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "10d03f83-affc-49a2-8c50-ef01b219a821",
    "doc_id": "api_gateway_architecture",
    "parent_id": "api_gateway_architecture",
    "source": "local_markdown",
    "title": "Api Gateway Architecture",
    "text": "The gateway routes to the checkout service, search service, user service, and payment service. Each downstream service is identified by its internal DNS name.",
    "section": "Downstream Services",
    "start_char": 0,
    "end_char": 158,
    "path": "data/raw/docs/api_gateway_architecture.md",
    "url": null,
    "created_at": null,
    "updated_at": null,
    "service": "search",
    "severity": null,
    "tags": [
      "checkout",
      "search",
      "timeout"
    ]
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "fbb480cb-241f-4777-a046-954a4d5e98c8",
    "doc_id": "api_gateway_architecture",
    "parent_id": "api_gateway_architecture",
    "source": "local_markdown",
    "title": "Api Gateway Architecture",
    "text": "The gateway enforces per-client rate limits. When a downstream service is degraded, the gateway can reduce the upstream request rate to prevent cascading failures.",
    "section": "Rate Limiting",
    "start_char": 0,
    "end_char": 163,
    "path": "data/raw/docs/api_gateway_architecture.md",
    "url": null,
    "created_at": null,
    "updated_at": null,
    "service": "search",
    "severity": null,
    "tags": [
      "checkout",
      "search",
      "timeout"
    ]
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "5315d50a-e7d4-47e8-8315-f0fb435be118",
    "doc_id": "api_gateway_architecture",
    "parent_id": "api_gateway_architecture",
    "source": "local_markdown",
    "title": "Api Gateway Architecture",
    "text": "Common failure modes include misconfigured routing rules, upstream service timeouts, and DNS resolution failures for internal service names. When DNS resolution fails, the gateway cannot forward requests and returns 502 to the client.",
    "section": "Failure Modes",
    "start_char": 0,
    "end_char": 234,
    "path": "data/raw/docs/api_gateway_architecture.md",
    "url": null,
    "created_at": null,
    "updated_at": null,
    "service": "search",
    "severity": null,
    "tags": [
      "checkout",
      "search",
      "timeout"
    ]
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "3134999a-d946-46f8-86f9-5335f4d3ec17",
    "doc_id": "api_gateway_architecture",
    "parent_id": "api_gateway_architecture",
    "source": "local_markdown",
    "title": "Api Gateway Architecture",
    "text": "The gateway includes a circuit breaker that opens when a downstream service error rate exceeds 50 percent over a 30-second window. Requests to that service are rejected immediately until the circuit resets.",
    "section": "Circuit Breaker",
    "start_char": 0,
    "end_char": 206,
    "path": "data/raw/docs/api_gateway_architecture.md",
