  {
    "chunk_id": "562c2e77-9eb2-452a-8767-8aad4744b478",
    "doc_id": "incident_2025_04_rate_limit",
    "parent_id": "incident_2025_04_rate_limit",
    "source": "local_markdown",
    "title": "Incident 2025 04 Rate Limit",
    "text": "The payment service began receiving HTTP 429 responses from the third-party payment provider during a promotional flash sale, causing checkout failures for a subset of users.",
    "section": "Summary",
    "start_char": 0,
    "end_char": 174,
    "path": "data/raw/incidents/incident_2025_04_rate_limit.md",
    "url": null,
    "created_at": null,
    "updated_at": null,
    "service": "checkout",
    "severity": "sev2",
    "tags": [
      "checkout"
    ]
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "eac14f3c-ba76-4d04-ac50-30e74fe0e277",
    "doc_id": "incident_2025_04_rate_limit",
    "parent_id": "incident_2025_04_rate_limit",
    "source": "local_markdown",
    "title": "Incident 2025 04 Rate Limit",
    "text": "Roughly 8 percent of checkout attempts failed with payment errors for 31 minutes. Revenue impact was estimated at approximately $14,000 during the window.",
    "section": "Impact",
    "start_char": 0,
    "end_char": 154,
    "path": "data/raw/incidents/incident_2025_04_rate_limit.md",
    "url": null,
    "created_at": null,
    "updated_at": null,
    "service": "checkout",
    "severity": "sev2",
    "tags": [
      "checkout"
    ]
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "92944226-2cc6-4812-888b-475c7f1f5ebe",
    "doc_id": "incident_2025_04_rate_limit",
    "parent_id": "incident_2025_04_rate_limit",
    "source": "local_markdown",
    "title": "Incident 2025 04 Rate Limit",
    "text": "The flash sale generated a 6x spike in payment authorization requests. The payment service had no per-second throttle and submitted requests to the provider at the raw rate they arrived. The provider enforced a rate limit of 200 requests per second; the service was peaking at approximately 1,100 per second. Requests above the limit were rejected with 429 responses that the service surfaced to users as checkout errors.",
    "section": "Root Cause",
    "start_char": 0,
    "end_char": 421,
    "path": "data/raw/incidents/incident_2025_04_rate_limit.md",
    "url": null,
    "created_at": null,
    "updated_at": null,
    "service": "checkout",
    "severity": "sev2",
    "tags": [
      "checkout"
    ]
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "caee972f-e57d-4322-9777-025096ae8f40",
    "doc_id": "incident_2025_04_rate_limit",
    "parent_id": "incident_2025_04_rate_limit",
    "source": "local_markdown",
    "title": "Incident 2025 04 Rate Limit",
    "text": "The on-call team added a token bucket rate limiter in the payment service capped at 180 requests per second and introduced a retry queue for rejected requests. Within 10 minutes, the error rate dropped to zero.",
    "section": "Mitigation",
    "start_char": 0,
    "end_char": 210,
    "path": "data/raw/incidents/incident_2025_04_rate_limit.md",
